                ],
                [
                    95.0,
                    1259.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) In 1975, proclaimed the UN International Year of Women, the First World Conference on Women in Mexico marked a turning point from a gender-blind to a female-centered perspective. The subsequent UN Decade for",
